    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Lords of the Forge",
    "summary": "Each time you select this unit to shoot in your Shooting phase, if it is not **battle-shocked** at that moment, you may roll a D6. On a 2+, pick one result:\n\n- an enemy **VEHICLE** unit no more than 12\" away from this unit takes a **battle-shock roll** at -1, and each unit can be picked for this at most once a turn\n- the ranged attacks this unit makes as it shoots do not stop it from being **hidden**",
